---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="sk">
    <head>
        <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
        <style>
            .home-hero {
                padding: 3em 0 2em;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
                margin-bottom: 2.5em;
            }

            .home-hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.4em;
                margin: 0 0 0.5em;
                line-height: 1.15;
            }

            .home-hero h1 span {
                color: var(--accent);
            }

            .home-hero .intro {
                color: var(--text-muted);
                font-size: 1.05em;
                line-height: 1.7;
                max-width: 580px;
                margin: 0 0 1.5em;
            }

            .home-actions {
                display: flex;
                gap: 0.75em;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .btn-primary {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 0.4em;
                padding: 0.6em 1.25em;
                background: var(--accent);
                color: #fff;
                border-radius: 4px;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 0.95em;
                transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
            }

            .btn-primary:hover {
                background: var(--accent-dark);
                color: #fff;
                transform: translateY(-1px);
            }

            .btn-secondary {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 0.4em;
                padding: 0.6em 1.25em;
                background: transparent;
                color: var(--text-muted);
                border: 1px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 4px;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 0.95em;
                transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
            }

            .btn-secondary:hover {
                border-color: var(--accent);
                color: var(--accent);
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 0.8em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                letter-spacing: 0.08em;
                color: var(--text-muted);
                font-weight: 700;
                margin: 0 0 1em;
            }

            .blurb-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
                gap: 1em;
            }

            @media (max-width: 600px) {
                .blurb-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
            }

            .blurb-card {
                padding: 1.25em;
                border: 1px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 5px;
                background: var(--card-bg);
            }

            .blurb-card .blurb-emoji {
                font-size: 1.5em;
                margin-bottom: 0.4em;
                display: block;
            }

            .blurb-card p {
                margin: 0;
                color: var(--text-muted);
                font-size: 0.9em;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }

            .blurb-card strong {
                color: var(--text);
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <main>
            <div class="home-hero">
                <h1>Vitaj na <span>Marošovom</span> blogu.</h1>
                <p class="intro">
                    Som prekvapený, že tu si. Píšem o cestovaní, podnikaní,
                    filozofii a iných veciach, čo mi napadnú o 4 ráno pri káve.
                    Sem-tam niečo zmysluplné. Hlavne nie.
                </p>
                <div class="home-actions">
                    <a href="/blog" class="btn-primary">Čítaj blog →</a>
                    <a href="/about" class="btn-secondary">O mne</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="section-title">Čo tu nájdeš</p>
            <div class="blurb-grid">
                <div class="blurb-card">
                    <span class="blurb-emoji">✈️</span>
                    <p><strong>Travel</strong> — Výlety, exkurzie, náhodné konverzácie v cudzích mestách a jahody, ktoré smrdeli ako chemická zbraň.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="blurb-card">
                    <span class="blurb-emoji">🧠</span>
                    <p><strong>Philosophy</strong> — Otázky, ktoré mi padajú do hlavy keď by som mal spať. Odpovede zvyčajne nemám.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="blurb-card">
                    <span class="blurb-emoji">🎲</span>
                    <p><strong>Random</strong> — Všetko ostatné. Podnikanie, personal brand, prečo mám stále pocit že mám niečo zabudnuté.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>
